            <ArticleTitle>[Multiple osteomas of the maxillary sinus. Presentation of a case].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>80-2, 85</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This case report concerns a case of multiple osteomas of the maxillary sinus which probably arise from flogosis and discusses the clinical features. The review of the literature on the histogenesis of these rare lesions remains controversial and it is still difficult to formulate a precise definition.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
